  "notes": "Contract written during the 2026-10-04 MDN-shape upgrade. The feature adds no new header or JS API; the surface is the existing Document-Policy header plus the new dedicated-worker derivation rules (Chrome 147 developer trial behind DocumentPolicyInDedicatedWorker). Error handling is documented at #error-handling, including a documented unknown: worker-context violation reporting (report-to / Document-Policy-Report-Only) is unspecified in the sources checked 2026-10-04 and the page says so explicitly rather than inventing behaviour. BCD has no Document-Policy entry (absence verified against BCD v8.1.4, 2026-10-01), so the compat table is interim ChromeStatus data, labelled as such on-page. whatwg/html PR #12026's merge state was unverifiable from this environment and the specifications table states that. Independent integrator source review still required for the implementation-sufficient claim."
